Derived files, and how they were changed (License section 4(b)):

  - host/skills-host.js
      Adapted from dsh-egm adapters/dsh/skills-host.js. Changed: registers
      this package's campaign skills instead of the vendored EGM skills;
      simplified frontmatter parser; new integration preamble; package root
      is one level up.
  - reviewers/*.md, lenses/*.md
      The persona structure and the "Core Mandates" section (read-only,
      fresh context, no chitchat) are adapted from the EGM persona files
      (agents/*.md). Changed: rewritten for tabletop RPG campaign review;
      roles, checks, and output formats are new.
  - skills/campaign-brainstorm/SKILL.md
      The workflow shape (clarify, readiness gate, parallel Goldfish lenses,
      brief, handoff) and several constraints are adapted from EGM
      skills/egm-brainstorm/SKILL.md. Changed: rewritten for campaign prep;
      the eight-step questions, seven lenses, and post-session debrief are
      new.
  - skills/campaign-draft/SKILL.md, skills/campaign-review/SKILL.md
      Follow the section-by-section approval gates of EGM egm-draft and the
      fresh-reviewer passes of EGM egm-review. Changed: rewritten for
      campaign documents; sections, passes, and report format are new.

All other files (the standard, templates, tests, and documentation) are
original to this package. No files from dsh-egm or EGM are included
unchanged. At runtime this package uses dsh-egm's `egm_reviewer` tool and
`egm-reviewer` preset, which are installed separately.

This package is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Google,
